OL,3,GNEWSAOne person seriously injured in
OL,4,AM25 rush-hour crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person was seriously injured in a
OL,7,Frush-hour crash on the M25 on Friday
OL,8,Fmorning, Surrey Police said.
OL,10,FThe force said it was called just after
OL,11,F08:30 BST to the clockwise stretch
OL,12,Fbetween junction five, for the M26, and
OL,13,Fjunction six, for Godstone and the A22.
OL,15,FThe crash involved two cars and a van
OL,16,Fand four people were reported injured,
OL,17,Fone seriously, with three taken to
OL,18,Fhospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
