OL,3,GNEWSAOne person seriously injured in
OL,4,AM25 rush-hour crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice attended, alongside South East
OL,7,FCoast Ambulance Service, Surrey Fire
OL,8,Fand Rescue Service and National
OL,9,FHighways, and thanked members of the
OL,10,Fpublic who assisted with first aid at
OL,11,Fthe scene.
